      "hints": ["Separate position, direction, colour and dot count. Check whether a move depends on a different element or the previous frame.","Test whether position and arrow follow separate patterns. If not, compare the current and previous-frame drivers; distinguish a colour gate from an orientation gate.","marker moves alternate: 3 places clockwise, then reflect position p to (2 − p) modulo 8; number the ring clockwise from 0 at the top. from frame 2 onward the arrow points 270° clockwise from the previous marker position. Predict the remaining colour/count or panel features before choosing."],
