      "solution": ["marker moves alternate: 3 places clockwise, then reflect position p to (2 − p) modulo 8; number the ring clockwise from 0 at the top. Frames 1–6, marker position: lower-right → left → bottom → upper-left → lower-right → left. Next: bottom.","from frame 2 onward the arrow points 270° clockwise from the previous marker position. Frames 1–6, arrow direction: 315° clockwise from up → 45° clockwise from up → 180° clockwise from up → 90° clockwise from up → 225° clockwise from up → 45° clockwise from up. Next: 180° clockwise from up.","the marker colour cycles black → grey → white and repeats. Frames 1–6, marker colour: black → grey → white → black → grey → white. Next: black.","the bottom dots cycle 4 → 3 → 2 → 1 and repeat. Frames 1–6, number of bottom dots: 4 → 3 → 2 → 1 → 4 → 3. Next: 2."],
