      "solution": ["Grid: the moves alternate. From frame 1 to 2 the middle row moves one cell to the left; from frame 2 to 3 the left column moves one cell up; the pattern repeats, wrapping round. Next (frame 5 to 6): the middle row moves one cell to the left.","Background: white → grey → white → grey → white. It alternates, so next: grey.","Corner marker: bottom-left → bottom-right → top-right → top-left → bottom-left, one corner anticlockwise each step. Next: bottom-right.","Marker colour: white → black → white → black → white. Next: black."],
