      "hints": ["Separate position, direction, colour and dot count. Check whether a move depends on a different element or the previous frame.","Test whether position and arrow follow separate patterns. If not, compare the current and previous-frame drivers; distinguish a colour gate from an orientation gate.","the arrow alternates turns of -90° and -45° clockwise (negative means anticlockwise). from frame 2 onward the marker is 180° clockwise from the PREVIOUS arrow direction. Predict the remaining colour/count or panel features before choosing."],
      "optionNotes": ["Correct: marker position: upper-right; arrow direction: 180° clockwise from up; marker colour: grey; number of bottom dots: 1.","Wrong: marker colour is black; it should be grey.","Wrong: arrow direction is 90° clockwise from up; it should be 180° clockwise from up; marker colour is black; it should be grey.","Wrong: marker colour is black; it should be grey; number of bottom dots is 4; it should be 1.","Wrong: marker position is left; it should be upper-right; arrow direction is 45° clockwise from up; it should be 180° clockwise from up."],
      "solution": ["the arrow alternates turns of -90° and -45° clockwise (negative means anticlockwise). Frames 1–6, arrow direction: 225° clockwise from up → 135° clockwise from up → 90° clockwise from up → 0° clockwise from up → 315° clockwise from up → 225° clockwise from up. Next: 180° clockwise from up.","from frame 2 onward the marker is 180° clockwise from the PREVIOUS arrow direction. Frames 1–6, marker position: upper-right → upper-right → upper-left → left → bottom → lower-right. Next: upper-right.","the marker colour cycles grey → white → black and repeats. Frames 1–6, marker colour: grey → white → black → grey → white → black. Next: grey.","the bottom dots cycle 3 → 4 → 1 → 2 and repeat. Frames 1–6, number of bottom dots: 3 → 4 → 1 → 2 → 3 → 4. Next: 1."],
