      "solution": ["Outer quadrants: each pattern moves one quadrant anticlockwise per step. Next: top-left vertical stripes, top-right rising diagonal hatching, bottom-right white, bottom-left horizontal stripes.","Inner circle: the black segment stays upper-right; the other three patterns move one segment clockwise among the remaining segments. Next: upper-right black, lower-right falling diagonal hatching, lower-left rising diagonal hatching, upper-left dots.","Centre square: grey → white → grey → white → grey. Next: white."],
