      "solution": ["Grid: the moves alternate. From frame 1 to 2 the bottom row moves one cell to the left; from frame 2 to 3 the left column moves one cell down; the pattern repeats, wrapping round. Next (frame 5 to 6): the bottom row moves one cell to the left.","Background: grey → white → grey → white → grey. It alternates, so next: white.","Corner marker: top-right → top-left → bottom-left → bottom-right → top-right, one corner anticlockwise each step. Next: top-left.","Marker colour: black → white → black → white → black. Next: white."],
